{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00691",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.8,
      "end_seconds": 14.01,
      "duration_seconds": 12.21,
      "text": "Morning. I'll be honest, I've got forty minutes before a site meeting, so can we be efficient? It's about my gout, and my kidneys."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 16.67,
      "end_seconds": 26.01,
      "duration_seconds": 9.34,
      "text": "We'll be efficient but thorough, because the two are connected. Tell me about the gout first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 28.38,
      "end_seconds": 38.41,
      "duration_seconds": 10.03,
      "text": "Big toe, left foot, swelled up last week, red and agony. It's gone down now, three days of tablets."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 41.17,
      "end_seconds": 45.4,
      "duration_seconds": 4.23,
      "text": "And what did you take for it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 47.81,
      "end_seconds": 56.23,
      "duration_seconds": 8.42,
      "text": "Naproxen, 500 mg, twice a day, from the stash I keep. I always have some."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 58.84,
      "end_seconds": 63.97,
      "duration_seconds": 5.13,
      "text": "That's important. Let's go through everything you take."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 67.45,
      "end_seconds": 80.85,
      "duration_seconds": 13.4,
      "text": "Allopurinol, 100 mg once a day. Ramipril, 5 mg once a day. Amlodipine, 5 mg once a day. And atorvastatin, 20 mg at night."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.15,
      "end_seconds": 87.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "Good. And your conditions, remind me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 89.06,
      "end_seconds": 99.55,
      "duration_seconds": 10.49,
      "text": "Gout, obviously. Kidney function, the blood tests said it's dropped a bit, chronic kidney disease, they called it. And high blood pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 102.7,
      "end_seconds": 105.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "Any gout in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 108.71,
      "end_seconds": 113.19,
      "duration_seconds": 4.48,
      "text": "My father had it terribly, in his fifties."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.18,
      "end_seconds": 119.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "Let me check you. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 121.91,
      "end_seconds": 123.61,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7,
      "text": "Right. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.46,
      "end_seconds": 147.59,
      "duration_seconds": 7.13,
      "text": "Pulse 72, blood pressure 144 over 88, temperature 36.6, oxygen 98 percent, weight 94 kilos."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 149.64,
      "end_seconds": 152.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "Is the pressure bad? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.44,
      "end_seconds": 165.32,
      "duration_seconds": 10.88,
      "text": "A bit above where I'd like, and I'll come back to that. Now let me look at the toe. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 168.91,
      "end_seconds": 172.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "Looks normal to me. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 184.5,
      "end_seconds": 192.02,
      "duration_seconds": 7.52,
      "text": "The big toe joint is no longer red or swollen, just a little tender."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 194.46,
      "end_seconds": 198.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "Told you. So what's the issue? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 201.41,
      "end_seconds": 217.18,
      "duration_seconds": 15.77,
      "text": "Here's the thing. Naproxen is an anti-inflammatory, and with kidney disease, and on ramipril, it can damage the kidneys further. I'd like you to stop using it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 220.64,
      "end_seconds": 226.52,
      "duration_seconds": 5.88,
      "text": "It's the only thing that works for the toe. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 228.57,
      "end_seconds": 238.99,
      "duration_seconds": 10.42,
      "text": "There are safer options for a flare, and we'll agree them. For now, keep the naproxen out of the drawer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 241.01,
      "end_seconds": 244.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.11,
      "text": "Fine. And the allopurinol? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 246.29,
      "end_seconds": 258.91,
      "duration_seconds": 12.62,
      "text": "That's the right drug for preventing attacks, and the dose is suitable for your kidneys. Keep taking it daily, even when the toe's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 261.66,
      "end_seconds": 263.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "I do. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 265.91,
      "end_seconds": 274.52,
      "duration_seconds": 8.61,
      "text": "And drink plenty of water, at least two litres, and keep the beer low."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 277.98,
      "end_seconds": 281.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "The beer, again. Right. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 282.96,
      "end_seconds": 287.47,
      "duration_seconds": 4.51,
      "text": "That's all I need for today. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 290.2,
      "end_seconds": 291.93,
      "duration_seconds": 1.73,
      "text": "Good. Thanks. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 295.23,
      "end_seconds": 299.86,
      "duration_seconds": 4.63,
      "text": "Mind that toe on the ladders this afternoon. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 302.68,
      "end_seconds": 305.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "I'll wear the proper boots. ~"
    }
  ]
}
